<Base page="about" title="About, Joshua Markle">
  <section class="is">
    <h1 data-fade data-say>Joshua Markle is a</h1>
    <div class="halo" data-liquid="prog/rammer, art/ist, entre/preneur, tink/erer, type/nerd" role="img" aria-label="programmer, artist, entrepreneur, tinkerer, type nerd"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="says">
    <p class="say" data-fade data-say>I am passionate and obsessive about fitness, programming, business, and philosophy. Currently a computer science student at UVA.</p>
    <p class="say" data-fade data-say>Outside of academia, I race on the triathlon team, surf and snowboard whenever I can, and read a lot about psychology and technology.</p>
    <p class="say" data-fade data-say>I'm currently looking for internships and job opportunities. Reach me at <a href="mailto:joshuamarkle25@gmail.com">joshuamarkle25@gmail.com</a> or check out my resume.</p>
    <a class="pill" data-pill href="/JoshuaMarkleResume.pdf"><span class="lab">Resume</span></a>
  </section>
  <section class="keys">
    <div class="typed" data-type aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="corne" data-corne role="img" aria-label="A Corne split keyboard, in glass. Type to press its keys."></div>
    <img class="flat" src="/work/corne.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
